      "settings": {
        "title": "Oberndörfer × Trax NYC",
        "text": "<p>For Trax NYC, a custom jeweller in Manhattan’s Diamond District, we made four cases in full-grain calf, lined in red Alcantara, with solid brass galvanised in gold: a jewellery box, a necklace trunk, a briefcase and a mini trunk. One example of each.</p>"
      }
